1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,160
Every Sunday, Juno and her fern have a standoff.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,240
She waters, she guesses, she hopes.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,260
And the fern still sulks.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,915
Then she reads the cap.

5
00:00:09,915 --> 00:00:11,326
One capful per litre.

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,820
Every two weeks.

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:13,620
No more guessing.

8
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,578
Standoff over.

9
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,438
Sprigly.

10
00:00:17,438 --> 00:00:19,173
One capful, no guessing.
